Get Payment Log > OpenAPI definition #/components/schemas/CbuaePaymentLogPaymentResponseLfi

{
 "description": "A payment the LFI settled on its own ledger. The debtor and creditor accounts are both held at the LFI, so the payment did not reach an external rail.\n",
