{
 "description": "A list of reject reason codes provided by the LFI. \nWhere this list is patched repeatedly the LFI **MUST** append to the existing list **BEFORE** calling the patch operation, to ensure all values are maintained, unless the reject reason was patched in error and the existing value is being replaced.\n",
 "type": "array",
